  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes an LC031 false negative: Chunk is no longer treated as a bounding operator. There is no Queryable.Chunk, so db.Users.Chunk(1000).ToList() binds to Enumerable.Chunk and materializes the entire table before partitioning — the size argument bounds the chunk size, not the rows fetched. Chunk was whitelisted alongside Take/First, suppressing the diagnostic on exactly the unbounded load LC031 exists to catch. A real bounding operator before the chunk (e.g. Take(100).Chunk(10)) still suppresses correctly.",
